### 마케팅 배너 API
### Base URL: https://localhost.example.com:8080

@baseUrl = https://localhost.example.com:8080

# 아래 토큰은 실행 전 로그인 후 발급받은 토큰으로 교체
@adminToken = Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>
@marketerToken = Bearer <MARKETER_TOKEN>

# 슬롯/광고 ID는 생성 후 응답에서 복사해서 사용
@slotId = <SLOT_ID>
@adId = <AD_ID>


### ============================
### [고객] 활성 배너 목록 조회
### ============================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/banners
Accept: application/json


### ============================
### [관리자] 슬롯 생성
### ============================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banner/slots
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "메인 상단 배너",
  "maxCount": 3
}


### ============================
### [관리자] 슬롯 목록 조회
### ============================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banner/slots
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================
### [관리자] 슬롯 단건 조회
### ============================

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banner/slots/{{slotId}}
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ============================
### [마케터] 광고 등록
### ============================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/marketer/banner-ads
Authorization: {{marketerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": "{{slotId}}",
  "title": "여름 세일 광고",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/images/summer-sale.png",
  "linkUrl": "https://example.com/sale",
  "priority": 1,
  "startsAt": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+09:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-08-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}


### ============================
### [마케터] 광고 수정 (PENDING 상태만 가능)
### ============================

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/marketer/banner-ads/{{adId}}
Authorization: {{marketerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "여름 세일 광고 (수정)",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/images/summer-sale-v2.png",
  "linkUrl": "https://example.com/sale",
  "priority": 2,
  "startsAt": "2026-07-28T00:00:00+09:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-08-31T23:59:59+09:00"
}


### ============================
### [관리자] 광고 승인
### ============================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banner/ads/{{adId}}/approve
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json


### ============================
### [관리자] 광고 거절
### ============================

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/banner/ads/{{adId}}/reject
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
